<title>UK: Hillsdown deputy chairman Jackson to resign.</title>
<headline>Hillsdown deputy chairman Jackson to resign.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British diversified manufacturer Hillsdown Holdings said on Thursday its deputy chairman John Jackson would be leaving the group by the end of this month, by mutual agreement, to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
